@darthvaderginsburg One issue of ai generated content is that real humans CAN talk like that too. I don't think that many do, but it affects the ones that do.. unfortunately, those people need to change the way they speak or they will get thought of as AI.
Em dashes, "It's not blank, it's blank", "blank doesn't just blank, it blanks" There's more common things AI uses, but those are the ones I recognize the easiest.

Recently I saw a steam game with a *very* similar writing style to AI, and I had to think about it for a long time to come to the conclusion that it wasn't actually AI, but very unfortunately close to it.
